    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.009",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 9,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 159,
      "width": 342,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 44,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 49,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "一些",
        "值得了解的事。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-5d10a8202ac7",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.010",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 10,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 287,
      "width": 335,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 26.4,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA 保存什么、你可以控制什么，以及内测阶",
        "段不作哪些承诺。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-626aaaf8531f",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.011",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 11,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 409.8,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 409.8,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.012",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 12,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 436.8,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA 保存什么？"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-b489db01f851",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.013",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 13,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 496.8,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA 主要保存你已发送的输入，以及回看所需的",
        "来源信息；这并不意味着复制全部 AI 回复或所有",
        "文件。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-68e054397389",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.014",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 14,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 618.05,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 618.05,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.015",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 15,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 645.05,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "我需要把所有内容都整理好吗",
        "？"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-fbbc548f84cc",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.016",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 16,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 738.05,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "不需要。阅读、找回、编辑和复制有用的话，本",
        "身就应该有价值。主题与可选的 AI 整理是增强能",
        "力，不是使用前提。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-5738350082c0",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.017",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 17,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 859.3,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 859.3,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.018",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 18,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 886.3,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "全部档案都会被发送给 AI 吗",
        "？"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-959dc5038307",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.019",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 19,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 979.3,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "不会。普通档案使用以本地为先。外部 AI 处理和",
        "上下文复用是分别授权、明确触发的操作。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-dbd48596dae5",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.020",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 20,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 1075.8,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 1075.8,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.021",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 21,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1102.8,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "现在可以在哪些平台上使用？"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-0bbf52a58ad5",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.022",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 22,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1162.8,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "当前邀请制内测为 Chrome 扩展，可在同意后捕",
        "获 ChatGPT 输入。其他平台、移动应用和外部 AI ",
        "读取连接器，不作为现在已可安装的能力承诺。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-5d457501a24e",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.023",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 23,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 1284.05,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 1284.05,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.024",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 24,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1311.05,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "有了聊天历史，为什么还需要",
        "它？"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-4a3a52baf411",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.025",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 25,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1404.05,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA 为你自己的话提供一个独立的工作层：回看",
        "、编辑、核对原话，再选择复用哪些内容。只使",
        "用一个 AI 产品，也可能有这样的需要。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-43a12da5dd60",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.026",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 26,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 1525.3,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 1525.3,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.027",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 27,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1552.3,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "我可以修改文字吗？"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-1270025d85bf",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.028",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 28,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1612.3,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "可以编辑工作版本，而不让今天的修改冒充昨天",
        "的原始表达。原始记录和工作版本承担不同职责",
        "。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-10933f7cd5b7",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.029",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 29,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 1733.55,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 1733.55,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.030",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 30,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1760.55,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "这是整个 AI 账号的备份吗？"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-2570e65d91e1",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.031",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 31,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1820.55,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "不是。捕获、受支持的历史导入和 PAIA 备份各有",
        "范围；内测产品不承诺完整恢复外部 AI 账号。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-fe483e1c2850",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.032",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 32,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 1917.05,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 1917.05,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.033",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 33,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1944.05,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "本地优先意味着完全不联网吗",
        "？"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-4770789b9c2d",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.034",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 34,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2037.05,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "不意味着。官网需要在线托管，申请内测使用已",
        "说明的转发服务，外部 AI 也有独立的联网边界。",
        "本地优先并不是加密认证。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-9d11af7f9458",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.035",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 35,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 2158.3,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 2158.3,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.036",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 36,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2185.3,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "我复制发送的文字，就是我的",
        "观点吗？"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-92ae6b6a4b7e",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.037",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 37,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2278.3,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "不一定。它可能是引用、岗位描述、草稿、问题",
        "或角色扮演。PAIA 应保留这种区别，而不是据此",
        "编造个人画像。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-c97f7ef31fd4",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.038",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 38,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 2399.55,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 2399.55,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.039",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 39,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2426.55,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "发给外部的内容，还能收回吗",
        "？"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-d0eb0ef60b44",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.040",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 40,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2519.55,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "不能。PAIA 可以停止由它控制的后续提供，但不",
        "能收回已经发送到外部系统或导出的副本。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-aaf9ac84cd92",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.041",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 41,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 2616.05,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 2616.05,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.042",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 42,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2643.05,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "官网示例展示的是我的真实档",
        "案吗？"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-ebd37bc6c22b",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.043",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 43,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2736.05,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "不是。示例使用虚构材料，不连接你的档案，也",
        "不调用实时 AI 模型。刷新会清除临时修改。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-e44b2b70eaf6",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-390.044",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 44,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 2832.55,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 2832.55,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
